{"id":"d078aa8f52adac6f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/617_选择函数条件逻辑.md","title":"617 选择函数条件逻辑","display":"617_选择函数条件逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{sel}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{sel}\\)</span>，显示</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow_f B=\\operatorname{sel}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\Rightarrow_f B=\\operatorname{sel}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{sel}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{sel}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow_f B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A\\Rightarrow_f B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{617}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{617}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A\\Rightarrow_f B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A\\Rightarrow_f B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{617}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{617}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{617}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{617}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{617}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{617}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{617}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中替换扩张为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow_f B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow_f\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow_f B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow_f\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{617}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{617}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{617}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{617}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{617}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{617}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{617}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{617}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{617}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{617}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,617}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,617}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{617}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{617}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{617}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{617}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{617}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{617}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择函数条件公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelK}^{617}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_f(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelK}^{617}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_f(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelTop}^{617}\n=\n\\{A\\Rightarrow_f\\top:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelTop}^{617}\n=\n\\{A\\Rightarrow_f\\top:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelAnd}^{617}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to((A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f(B\\land C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelAnd}^{617}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to((A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f(B\\land C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{617}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{617}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{617}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{617}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelK}^{617}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelTop}^{617}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelAnd}^{617}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{617}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{617}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{617}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{617}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelK}^{617}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelTop}^{617}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelAnd}^{617}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{617}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{617}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{617}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{617}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{617}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow_f C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{617}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow_f C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEC}^{617}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow_f C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEC}^{617}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow_f C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{617}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{617}\\)</span> 为四者并。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>。每行至少满足下列 6 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{617}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{617}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\to C\">\\(A_j=B\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow_f C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow_f C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(A_j=B\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{617}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{617}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{617}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{617}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{617}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{617}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{617}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{617}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。由证明前缀闭包，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{617}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{617}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{617}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{617}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{617}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{617}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{617}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{617}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{617}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{617}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{617}(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f C)}\\;(RCK),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{617}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{617}(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_f C)}\\;(RCK),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\vdash_{617}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{617}(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow_f C)}\\;(RCEA),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{617}B\\leftrightarrow C}{\\vdash_{617}(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow_f C)}\\;(RCEC).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\vdash_{617}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{617}(A\\Rightarrow_f C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\Rightarrow_f C)}\\;(RCEA),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{617}B\\leftrightarrow C}{\\vdash_{617}(A\\Rightarrow_f B)\\leftrightarrow(A\\Rightarrow_f C)}\\;(RCEC).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-选择函数语义\">8. 选择函数语义</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"617\">\\(617\\)</span>-选择函数模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SelMod}_{617}\">\\(\\mathsf{SelMod}_{617}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,f),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,f),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(f:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>。公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{617}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\to B⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\to B⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\Rightarrow_f B⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:f(w,⟦ A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\Rightarrow_f B⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:f(w,⟦ A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{617}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{617}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{617}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{617}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,f)\\in\\mathsf{SelMod}_{617}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{617}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{617}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{617}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,f)\\in\\mathsf{SelMod}_{617}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{617}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{617}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目把选择函数思想纯句法化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_f\">\\(\\Rightarrow_f\\)</span> 构造子，并加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelTop}^{617}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelTop}^{617}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelAnd}^{617}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{SelAnd}^{617}\\)</span>。这些公理表达选择输出上的真式保持与合取闭合，不引入选择函数语义对象。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p>所有前件、后件等价替换都是规则关系；证明对象规定这些规则只能由空依赖定理触发。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{SelCond}_{617}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\operatorname{FV}_{617},\\operatorname{BV}_{617},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{617},\\operatorname{Sub}_{617},\\equiv_{\\alpha,617},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{617},\\mathsf{Rule}_{617},\\mathsf{Proof}_{617},\\operatorname{last}_{617},\n\\vdash_{617},\\mathsf{Thm}_{617},\\mathsf{Cert}_{617},\n\\mathsf{SelMod}_{617},⟦-⟧_{617},\\Vdash_{617},\\models_{617}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{SelCond}_{617}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{617},\\operatorname{FV}_{617},\\operatorname{BV}_{617},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{617},\\operatorname{Sub}_{617},\\equiv_{\\alpha,617},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{617},\\mathsf{Rule}_{617},\\mathsf{Proof}_{617},\\operatorname{last}_{617},\n\\vdash_{617},\\mathsf{Thm}_{617},\\mathsf{Cert}_{617},\n\\mathsf{SelMod}_{617},⟦-⟧_{617},\\Vdash_{617},\\models_{617}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含选择函数风格条件句法演算、选择函数模型、满足关系与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-选择函数语义","text":"8. 选择函数语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"